     A            D3LRPR         1A         COLHDG('Last RTW Phys Rstr')
     A*
     A            D3LRSE         1A         COLHDG('Last RTW Same Emp')
     A*
     A*
     A            D3CDEK         8A         COLHDG('Cur Dt Emp Know DOD')
     A*
     A            D3CDAK         8A         COLHDG('Cur Dt Adm Know DOD')
     A*
     A            D3JRC#        25A         COLHDG('Jur Claim # Related')
     A*
     A            D3ALKD         8A         COLHDG('Acq Claim Ls Indm Dt')
